I urgently need a haircut.
I take my mobile phone.
I call a hair salon near me.
A man answers the phone.
"Hair salon Schmidt, hello," he says.
"Hello, my name is Maya Flores," I answer.
"I need an appointment for a haircut, please."
"Very gladly, Frau Flores," the hairdresser says.
"When do you have time?"
"I work every day until five o'clock," I explain.
"Do you have a free appointment in the evening?"
He thinks for a moment.
"We still have time on Wednesday," he says.
"Does Wednesday at six o'clock suit you?"
I look at my calendar.
Wednesday evening is still free.
"Wednesday at six o'clock fits perfectly," I answer.
"Wonderful, see you Wednesday!" the hairdresser says.
"Thank you very much, goodbye!" I say.
I am looking forward to the new haircut.
